                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Ok, now the game it's playable and funny again :)\nI'm not being payed: simply enough, the developers listen to the community!\nIt took a month, but the problem is now solved and I can, finally, continue my career with Kothen!\nI really hope to see more products and maybe some other stuff for this game!\n\n\\---/\n\nOk, just forget everything I written before.\n\nWhy? There is a bug in the game that prevent to play more than one season!\nYes, you have understan correctly: the game fails to load any game saved after season one!\n\nA fraud! Nothing else to say, as the developers don't answer or check the forum anymore...\n\n\\---/\n\nWell, this game was quite a surprise.\nI frankly expected the latest \"cheap\" sport/management sim (you know, terribly buggy, not tested, frustrating as... I think you could make an idea).\nI love this type of games, and, from my reviews, you can see HOW many simply failed to being a decent product because, well, often they simply... don't work; too buggy!\n\nThis game is simple, probably (surely) with an outdated graphic compartment, but... it works!\nI'm not an expert of handball, but I could play this with a little expertise and... without bugs!\n\nSo, I know this product doesn't seems so appealing at first, but I think it can be interesting, for genre fans.\n\nHowever, my congratulations to developers: at last, a sim game that works! Thank you!",
